   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Immunologiseminarium</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Seminar in Immunology</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">En kurs i immunologi som omfattades av fem dagar av f&#xf6;rel&#xe4;sningar och demonstrationer under ledning av fyra experter fr&#xe5;n Karolinska Institutet p&#xe5; Isaev Scientific Research Institute of Medical Parasitology. Deltagarna i kursen var b&#xe5;de studenter och personal p&#xe5; institutet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project consists of a contribution towards the costs of Swedish lecturers from the Karolinska Institute in Stockholm conducting a one week course in modern immunology at the Isaev Scientific Research Institute of Medical Parasitology. Participants in the course will be both staff and students of the Institute.</narrative>
  </description>
